        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBC250, 2-1/2 Inch Convex Wall Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe large 2-1/2 inch diameter door stop works great even with heavy doors. The rubber bumper is convex (protrudes outward). The Deltana made Steel 2-1/2 Inch Convex Door Bumper can be used anywhere from homes to schools to retail shopping malls to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. By mounting the door stop on the wall, and centering it where the door knob makes contact, you can protect both the wall and the knob. This 2-1/2 inch round flush wall mounted door bumper is available in 8 great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBC250-specifictions.gif?v=1704354643\" width=\"329\" height=\"169\" border=\"0\" atl=\"2-1/2 Inch Convex Wall Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WBC250 2-1/2 Inch Wall Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WBC250.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  WBC250 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be durable steel material. \r\n</p>",
