                "title": "Steel 2-1/2 Inch Convex Door Bumper",
                "description": "Deltana WBC250 This 2-1/2 inch round flush wall mounted door bumper (door stop) is available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware.  The rubber bumper is convex (protrudes outward). These wall mounted door bumpers are used everywhere from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. Anywhere you need to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall.",
